mpchess Asset Licenses
======================

This file documents the licenses for all bundled assets. The mpchess code
itself is licensed under MIT. See the project LICENSE file for details.


Original Project Assets (MIT)
=============================

The following assets are original to the mpchess project and distributed
under the project MIT License:

- background.png — AI-generated via ChatGPT (OpenAI image generation)
- pickup.wav — AI-generated using SoundCloud


