2D Piece Sets (pieces/2d/)
==========================

All 2D piece sets were downloaded from the Lichess project at commit
2762d8147ef1 (2024). Source directory:
https://github.com/lichess-org/lila/tree/2762d8147ef1/public/piece

License provenance from Lichess COPYING.md:
https://github.com/lichess-org/lila/blob/2762d8147ef1/COPYING.md

Most sets contain 12 SVG files (wK, wQ, wR, wB, wN, wP, bK, bQ, bR, bB, bN, bP).
Exceptions:
- **disguised**: 2 SVGs (w.svg, b.svg) shared via copies for all 12 piece names
- **mono**: 6 SVGs (B, K, N, P, Q, R) shared across white/black via copies
- **monarchy**: 12 .webp files (not SVG)


